      en: ["Founded in 1543 as the third capital of the Kingdom", "Capital of Central America until the 1773 earthquakes", "Designated a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1979", "Famous for elaborate sawdust carpets during Holy Week", "Framed by the peaks of Agua, Fuego, and Acatenango volcanoes", "Maintains a strict colonial-era architectural building code"],
